WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:07.262
AGE and direct subtraction both compare two temporal
values but their emphasis differs AGE

00:00:07.288 --> 00:00:13.646
expresses a symbolic calendar interval using years
months and days Direct

00:00:13.659 --> 00:00:19.490
subtraction gives the elapsed interval between two
timestamps For hospital

00:00:19.517 --> 00:00:25.450
length of stay direct subtraction is usually easier
to interpret For

00:00:25.477 --> 00:00:28.806
calendar-style age differences AGE may be more
natural
